# lib-soclover

Public API is `src/index.ts` (re-exports `classes` + `applyPatch`).

- `Card`, `Leaf`, `Game`, `SocloverMessage`, `MessageType` are the wire/domain contracts — changing them affects client and server
- `applyPatch` merges card patch fields onto a leaf by `playerName` + `slot`
- `cardUImembers` lists UI-only card fields — keep in sync if you add drag/guess properties
- Prefer additive, backwards-compatible message fields over breaking renames
